["er.eventlog.import-anchor/1",{"authority":{"logical_scope":"entity-runtime","stream_identity":"01a0cab7-1ed7-77a5-8384-ff10c92e7ad6","tenant":"planning"},"completeness":"available_evidence_only","evidence":[],"instance":{"entity":"aep.entity","fields":{"document":{"events":[],"fields":{"$aep":{"archived":false,"metadata":{"created_at":0,"id":"MIG3eef9b4c8319810f0a60ac2ac9ceba736613d5fd5bfc17e7d855e7858d41842a","locator":"ep://planning/store/story/entity-mcp-test-server","provenance":{"created_by":"system","updated_by":"system"},"revision":6,"type":"aep.story/v1","updated_at":0}},"body":"# Story: Mount entities as MCP tools for agent evaluation\n\n## Acceptance\n\nThe entity mcp command serves newline-delimited JSON-RPC over stdio for MCP 2026-07-28 and the 2025-11-25 initialization era. It exposes entity.create, entity.get, entity.list, entity.events and every non-conflicting named operation. Writes use File Store v2, require provenance, and operations require expected_revision. Tool failures are structured and actionable; protocol failures remain JSON-RPC errors; stdout contains protocol messages only. The public site includes a complete refund setup and call transcript.\n\n## Implementation evidence\n\nMoved to implemented on 2026-09-09 after an audit of every non-implemented artifact against `CHANGELOG.md`, `docs/roadmap.md` and the crates.\n\n`crates/entity-mcp` serves both protocol eras (`MODERN`, `LEGACY` in `src/lib.rs`), per-entity create/get/list/events plus named operations, requires provenance and `expected_revision`, keeps stdout protocol-only, and has its guide page `website/docs/guide/mcp.md`.\n","relations":[{"derived_from":"epic:generated-entity-surfaces"},{"depends_on":"story:generated-entity-contracts-and-docs"},{"serves":"vision:O2"}],"status":"implemented","summary":"A local stdio MCP server exposes stored reads, creates and named operations with schemas and typed refusals.","title":"Mount entities as MCP tools for agent evaluation"},"lifecycle_state":"implemented"}},"id":"MIG3eef9b4c8319810f0a60ac2ac9ceba736613d5fd5bfc17e7d855e7858d41842a","lifecycle_state":"recorded","revision":6,"version":1},"order":"per_kind_only","subject":["aep.entity","MIG3eef9b4c8319810f0a60ac2ac9ceba736613d5fd5bfc17e7d855e7858d41842a"]}]